Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得走了  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go, come on.
