Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蹲着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:15.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是谁  怎么打扮成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they? Why do they look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们喜欢吓唬人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They like scaring people.
