Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得跑去那个缺口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to run for that opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  他们会看到我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they'll see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要是忙着对付他  我们就能脱身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're busy with him we can lose the hunters, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟住我  好吗  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just stay with me. OK?  -  OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗  快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready... Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看客有时候会在窗前等着  保持观望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The onlookers sometimes wait in the windows, keeping lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们肯定就是这么发现我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pretty sure that's how they find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用摄像机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the cameras somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:10:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看客一发现你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Onlookers spot you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几分钟内恐怖混蛋就会赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a few minutes later the scary bastards turn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太疯狂了  简直太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is mad, this is just mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得撑着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you have to hold it together
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照我说的做  要不就没命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and do what I say or you'll get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在一栋房子里醒来  都不知道是不是我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I woke up in this house and I don't even know if it's my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连自己是谁都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定知道点什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这是我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.65,0:11:22.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不知道她在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能你是想自杀来着  能说得通吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you tried to kill yourself. Would that explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.23,0:11:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实有些药片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个开始后  不少人走了那条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots have tried that fun fork in the road since it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:33.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么开始后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since what started?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.87,0:11:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个信号  内容是闪动的图片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a signal... Like pictures, flashing pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们出现在每台电视  每台电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just appeared on every TV, every computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何有屏幕的东西上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anything with a screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到过  我看到过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号对人们产生了影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did something to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几乎每个人都变成了看客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, almost everybody just became onlookers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始旁观  录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}started watching, filming stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像漠不关心的旁观者一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like spectators who don't give a shit about what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在十之八九都是这样的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's, like, nine out of ten people now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人没有受到影响  我也不知道为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us weren't affected. I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如那个拿着枪的人  还有那个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like that man with the gun and that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫他们"猎手"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call them "hunters".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你已经注意到了  他们就是干这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might've noticed that's what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们自己没事  但随即意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seemed normal to begin with, but they realised
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己可以随心所欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they could do what they wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就开始到处抢掠  偷车  因为没人管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they started taking stuff, nicking cars cos they could,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为所欲为  不仅对物  还对人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doing what they like and not just with things, with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况愈发糟糕  现在他们还有观众了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It got worse and worse. And now they've got an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...电视上的这个东西...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this... this thing on the TV, the...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他们这样做的原因吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, that's what's doing it. That's what's making them act like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜他们其实一直都是这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they were always like that underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过现在规则变了  没有人管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just needed the rules to change, for no-one to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办  怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we going to do? What we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.21,0:12:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不做  我们逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do? Do nothing. We get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's "out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里  得向南去这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here. We need to head south of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那儿的发射机已被毁  那里很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've knocked the transmitters out, it's OK there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电视信号发射机  传送那个信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The TV transmitters, they carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们和安全区之间只有一台发射机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one between us and the safe zone and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去毁掉它  就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're going to knock it out. See, it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White Bear...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和两个最好的朋友一起野餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A picnic with my two best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  你怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, what is it with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白熊  你说了白熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White Bear, you said White Bear...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:34.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你有什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, whatever's wrong with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在都得振作起来  行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to keep it together. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  别出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me! Don't go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想看热闹吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? You want something to look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就让你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cos I'll give you something to look at!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我要跟他们谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I want to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想跟你们谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下不好玩了  是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not so funny now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想知道他们在看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to see what they're looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  快放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.81,0:14:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西很危险  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的电话很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their phones, they're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个信号  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屏幕上有那个图案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The images are on them, they're on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰迈玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jemima...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这不对劲  不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. This is all wrong. This is all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们追来了  快跑  跑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming. Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:47.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊  他们追上来了  快来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, now! They're coming! Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧点  快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, hurry up. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.49,0:15:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才差点撞死我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You nearly killed us back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不知道你们会突然冲出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I wasn't expecting you to be there, was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救了你们的命  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saved your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就不能说声谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not like a wee thank you' would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真该从你们身上碾过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've just run yous over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这问题不难  对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a hard question, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认得你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know... I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  你要是认得我  我们在哪见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you? Well, where did we meet, if you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Didn't think so, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在很混乱  状态不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's confused. She's not in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这儿干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what are yous doing out here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝南走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading south.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不明智  南边全封死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a good move. It's all blocked up down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有台发射机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a transmitter there...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没听懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.21,0:15:59.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说"那可不明智"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I said, "It's not a good move",
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是我不会开车送你们过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that means I'm not driving you down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a safe place we can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那片树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的地方是树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your safe place is in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:10.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  也许你是认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ, maybe you do know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们停车  然后下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we pull up and we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们讲了话  那里没人追我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talk. There's no-one chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神秘梅格附身(英国占星家)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mystic Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what happens?
