Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖躺下  亲爱的  来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie down for me, darling. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  就像泰迪熊那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just like what Teddy does.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖躺下  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie down for me, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.87,0:23:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白熊  白熊有些不对劲 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White Bear, there's something not right about White Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:41.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.85,0:23:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也"记得"树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You "Remembered" the woods, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我不能相信你的预感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Sorry if I don't trust your hunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Looks clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.94,0:24:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他总算还有点用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was good for something, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  我们该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up, we need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.10,0:24:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on... Get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.89,0:24:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.63,0:25:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和两个最好的朋友一起野餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A picnic with my two best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.25,0:25:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.36,0:25:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  他们随时会来  把平面图给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. They'll be here any minute. Give me the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.71,0:25:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射塔在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The transmitter tower's over there
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.99,0:25:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电缆一直铺到那栋建筑里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the cabling runs underground into that building.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.01,0:25:36.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不出所料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.50,0:25:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.27,0:27:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:09.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我烧了一切  我说真的  退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or everything goes up. I mean it... Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.22,0:27:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.30,0:28:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.94,0:28:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你很好奇为什么在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So. I guess you're wondering why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.66,0:28:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该告诉你你是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's time to tell you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.05,0:28:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那时比较精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've looked better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.09,0:29:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认出他了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you recognise him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.04,0:29:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的未婚夫  伊安·兰诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fiance, Iain Rannoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.15,0:29:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确切点说  是已故的未婚夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or, should I say, was your fiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.07,0:29:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你还没猜到  你们俩不太受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case you haven't guessed, the pair of you aren't very popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.62,0:29:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我倒是可以说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll tell you what you are though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.05,0:29:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们很有名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.47,0:29:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维多利亚·斯基兰的审判今日终于结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trial of Victoria Skillane finally concluded today,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.15,0:29:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被判有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the verdict, guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.26,0:29:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于其未婚夫伊安·兰诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together with her fiance Iain Rannoch,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.90,0:29:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在拘留期间死去  审判一度延迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose death in custody had delayed the trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.17,0:29:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两人在离家不远处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skillane abducted six-year-old
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.88,0:29:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绑架了六岁的杰迈玛·赛克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jemima Sykes just miles from her home,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.41,0:29:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从而引发全国范围的搜寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}prompting a nationwide search
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她父母也深切哀恳绑匪放人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}amidst emotional pleas from her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.71,0:29:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个月来  孩子的失踪始终谜团重重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For months, the youngster's disappearance had been a mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.55,0:29:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的线索是她特别的白色泰迪熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sole clue being her distinctive white teddy bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在离家两英里处的路边被人发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}discovered in a lay-by two miles from the family home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.14,0:29:52.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白熊变成了杰迈玛搜寻行动的永久标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The white bear became an enduring symbol in the hunt for Jemima,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.69,0:29:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜寻最终在当地的树林结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a hunt that ended in a local forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.47,0:29:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰迈玛的尸体就在这里被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jemima's body was found here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.49,0:29:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被人裹在一个睡袋里烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It had been wrapped in a sleeping bag and burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在斯基兰手机里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The couple were caught
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.67,0:30:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了一段令人发指的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after harrowing footage of Jemima's torture
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.83,0:30:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,折磨并杀害杰迈玛的录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and murder was discovered on a mobile phone
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.46,0:30:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随后这对情侣被捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Skillane's possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.01,0:30:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纹有特别纹身的伊安·兰诺克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iain Rannoch, identified by his distinctive tattoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.21,0:30:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀害了幼女  而维多利亚·斯基兰则在旁拍摄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killed the youngster as Victoria Skillane held the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯基兰泣不成声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaking down in tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.65,0:30:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承认拍下了杰迈玛的临终时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skillane admitted to filming Jemima's final moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.57,0:30:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并声称她是受未婚夫逼迫而协助他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}claiming her fiance had pressured her into helping him,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.53,0:30:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚称她是受了他的蛊惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maintaining she was "under his spell".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而陪审团则不相信斯基兰的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jury was not convinced by Skillane's story,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.95,0:30:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官也不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and neither was the judge,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.14,0:30:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并认为她"十分恶劣"  心地歹毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who labelled her a "Uniquely wicked" and poisonous individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.80,0:30:34.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说"你狂热地围观了杰迈玛受虐的过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You were an enthusiastic spectator to Jemima's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.19,0:30:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至着迷于她的痛苦"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You actively revelled in her anguish", he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.85,0:30:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理应适当增刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}adding her punishment would be proportionate and considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.06,0:30:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊安·兰诺克在囚室里上吊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By hanging himself in his cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.56,0:30:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人认为他逃过了制裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}many believe Iain Rannoch evaded justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.85,0:30:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是公众将目光转向他的同谋者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The public mood is now focussed on ensuring his accomplice
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.56,0:30:48.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确保她不能这样逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.07,0:30:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕特里克·雷希  UKN\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patrick Lacey, UKN.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.09,0:30:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.18,0:31:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别哭了  鳄鱼的眼泪真让人恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't start crying. Crocodile tears are making me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.01,0:31:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.93,0:31:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.05,0:31:21.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看着他行凶的时候可没哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were no tears when you watched him do what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拍下了他对那小姑娘的恶行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You filmed what he did. A poor wee girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她那么无助  那么害怕  而你只是看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helpless and terrified and you just watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.57,0:31:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.81,0:31:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.75,0:31:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.77,0:32:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带她下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.28,0:32:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她扔回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw her back to where she came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.63,0:32:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.55,0:32:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}NO! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.94,0:32:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好  市民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.70,0:32:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢各位今晚的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you so much for coming tonight. OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.40,0:32:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们达到了今天的高潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're at the climax of our day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.93,0:32:35.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想拍多少照片就拍吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take as many photographs as you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.89,0:32:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽可能多拍一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take as many photographs as you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.76,0:32:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但最重要的是  我需要你们做的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but most importantly, what I need from you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大声高喊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to shout and scream
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.55,0:32:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让那贱人知道你们在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let that bitch know that youse are out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.36,0:32:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让表演开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this show on the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.34,0:33:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人的贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdering bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.19,0:33:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶毒的巫婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evil witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.44,0:33:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dirty whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.35,0:33:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烧死那贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn the bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.57,0:33:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下地狱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.66,0:35:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我吧  求你杀了我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill me. Please just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.10,0:35:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.66,0:35:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.08,0:35:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天挺够呛的  但这个会让你都忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've had a bad day, but this will wipe it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.60,0:35:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你有心情再来一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get you in the mood to start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.89,0:35:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  求你  放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.08,0:35:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约三十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takes about 30 minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..For it to fully do the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.45,0:35:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So while it does....
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.77,0:36:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看会儿娱乐节目吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we watch some in-flight entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.11,0:36:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.13,0:36:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 健康食品  比如苹果  - 停下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Healthy stuff, like apples. -  Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.59,0:36:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你拍的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.74,0:36:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们放一起  这样我的两个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made it together, so that my two friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.69,0:36:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和两个最好的朋友一起野餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erm... A picnic for me and my two best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.49,0:37:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.65,0:37:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  各位  我们即将进入公园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK everyone, we're about to head into the park
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.01,0:37:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就交给巴克斯特了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I'll hand you over to Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.84,0:38:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.47,0:38:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的角色都十分重要  你们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of our roles are very, very important, yours included.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.08,0:38:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要遵守一些基本的规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, yours come with some basic rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.31,0:38:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一条  不许说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule number one, no talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.05,0:38:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不止对她  跟其他人也不行  除非是要紧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not just to her, but each other as well, unless it's essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.80,0:38:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们希望让她相信你们都被催眠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to get her to believe that youse are all mesmerised.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.95,0:38:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  但到目前  她都信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know, I know, but she's believed it up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.21,0:38:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二条规则  保持距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, rule number two, keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.87,0:38:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一条万分的重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stress the importance of this one enough, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.39,0:38:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了  她是个危险的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget, she's a dangerous individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她想成一个在逃的狮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine that she's an escaped lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.53,0:38:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天她向人群投掷了东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now yesterday, she threw a projectile,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.79,0:38:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她离得太近我们都会插手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we will step in if she gets too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.94,0:38:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都有电击枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all equipped with tasers,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.37,0:38:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那样就会中断进程  这一天也白费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then we're into story shutdown and we've all wasted a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.73,0:38:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以各位最好保持三米以上的距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's best to keep your distance at least three metres back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.06,0:38:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以用摄像机聚焦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can use your camera zoom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.09,0:38:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后  但也同样重要  是好好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last, but not least, enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可能是最重要的一条了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably the most important rule of all, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.43,0:39:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍照片  在林子里跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take photographs, run around through the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.67,0:39:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但要小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but try and stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.88,0:39:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会随时监控保证你们的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be keeping an eye on you, making sure you're all OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.90,0:39:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家进园好好玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So get out there, enjoy yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.56,0:39:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来献上一出好戏吧  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let's make this show happen, people! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.30,0:39:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧啊  她在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.84,0:39:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  我挺累的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know yet. I'm kind of knackered.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.23,0:39:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.34,0:40:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她离开家了  最多两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just leaving her house now. Two minutes tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.33,0:40:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.34,0:40:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.03,0:40:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.05,0:40:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想杀我  怎么回事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to fucking kill me. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.14,0:40:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去拿那个灭火器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that extinguisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.11,0:40:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  他们走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK, they've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.06,0:40:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真像回事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Convincing, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.17,0:40:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.80,0:41:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.02,0:41:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Early screamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.18,0:41:28.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚真令人激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an early screamer tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.78,0:41:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家闹起来  开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So keep the noise up and let's go!
